            "It establishes a finding central to the text's\ndiscussion of a practical application\nresulting from the team's study of fungal\nthermal biology."
          ],
          "answer": 3,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is D (Answer Key: Topic 10, Q25). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
        }
      ]
