            "They identify factors that Alfonzo argues\nhave been overemphasized in studies of\ndecision-making about walking but that\nthe text asserts are relevant to most\npeople's walking decisions."
          ],
          "answer": 2,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is C (Answer Key: Topic 10, Q39). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
